# 统一换行符：仓库内一律按 LF 存储，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时出现「整文件都改了」的假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则可能无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止 Git 做任何换行转换或文本处理
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.jar   binary
*.zip   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.sqlite binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary

# 锁文件由工具自动生成，不计入 GitHub 语言统计
Cargo.lock        linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated

# 随包分发的第三方库，不计入本项目的语言统计
src/vendor/* linguist-vendored
